        "kind": "alias",
        "documentation": "The ERROR of the blocks (USINT): LIO_NO_ERROR, LIO_NOT_SUPPORTED (not a Linux target), LIO_WRONG_INPUT, LIO_NOT_FOUND (no such pin, chip, file or device), LIO_BUSY (the pin is in use), LIO_REFUSED (the driver refused the settings), LIO_IO_ERROR, LIO_NO_SLOT (more than 64 blocks)."
